This product reads the OpenTelemetry Protocol. Its message definitions, including every field number and
the JSON encoding rules it follows, come from:

  OpenTelemetry Protocol (OTLP) definitions
  https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-proto
  Copyright The OpenTelemetry Authors
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

The .proto files of release v1.11.0 are included unmodified under proto-reference/, so the definitions
this package implements can be read beside it. They are not compiled.

This product is not an official OpenTelemetry distribution and is not affiliated with or endorsed by the
OpenTelemetry project or the Cloud Native Computing Foundation. OpenTelemetry is a trademark of The Linux
Foundation.
